      "info": [
        {
          "id": "f1",
          "face": "right",
          "x": 920,
          "y": 540,
          "title": "Define the question",
          "text": "A model answers a specific question.\n\nWrite the required output first.\n\nThen decide which inputs are necessary.\n\nChallenge: Why define the output before selecting data?\n\nThe required answer determines which data the model needs."
        },
        {
          "id": "f2",
          "face": "right",
          "x": 1888,
          "y": 540,
          "title": "Signed coordinates",
          "text": "Northern latitudes are positive.\n\nSouthern latitudes are negative.\n\nA larger latitude is further north.\n\nChallenge: Which is further north: -8 or -21? Explain.\n\n-8 is larger than -21, so it is further north."
        },
        {
          "id": "f3",
          "face": "back",
          "x": 920,
          "y": 540,
          "title": "Equality matters",
          "text": "Two values can be equal.\n\nA two-way comparison may miss this case.\n\nSpecify an output for every valid case.\n\nChallenge: Why is an equality case needed?\n\nWithout it, equal latitudes could be incorrectly labelled north or south."
        },
        {
          "id": "f4",
          "face": "back",
          "x": 1888,
          "y": 540,
          "title": "Inputs and processing",
          "text": "Inputs supply the data.\n\nProcesses transform or compare it.\n\nOutputs communicate the result.\n\nChallenge: Classify multiplying distance by 2.\n\nIt is a process because it transforms the input into the fare."
        },
        {
          "id": "f5",
          "face": "left",
          "x": 920,
          "y": 540,
          "title": "Change the requirement",
          "text": "A new requirement may need new data.\n\nReview the model before adding detail.\n\nKeep the change relevant to the new purpose.\n\nChallenge: What extra coordinate supports east/west comparison?\n\nLongitude supports comparing east/west positions within a stated coordinate convention."
        },
        {
          "id": "f6",
          "face": "left",
          "x": 1888,
          "y": 540,
          "title": "Test the simplified model",
          "text": "Use examples with known answers.\n\nInclude less obvious cases.\n\nRefine the rules if an example fails.\n\nChallenge: Why test equal and negative latitudes?\n\nThey check equality and signed-number comparisons that positive unequal examples may miss."
        }
      ],
